# Implementation Plan - User Management Module Backend Enhancements

Develop the backend user management features to fully satisfy the specifications and KPIs of Module 2 (User Management Module) in [KPI_enterprise_expense_management.md](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/agents/KPI_enterprise_expense_management.md).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **PII Log Masking**: We will implement a global exception filter `PiiMaskingExceptionFilter` that intercepts all HTTP exceptions. It will scan error messages, payloads, and logs to mask email addresses and names, satisfying the security requirements of `USR-08` (0 PII exposed in non-authenticated error responses).
> - **Soft-Delete Session Invalidation**: When an administrator deactivates a user (setting `isActive: false`), the backend will immediately contact Redis to delete all active session tokens (`refresh:userId:*`), forcing an immediate logout for `USR-07`.

